    "text": "By Sarah Shook ,\n8 hours ago A Tornado Watch has been issued for DeKalb, Marshall, and Morgan counties until 11 p.m. Wednesday. The watch includes Albertville, Arab, Boaz, Decatur, Fort Payne, Guntersville, and Rainsville. Turn to WAAY 31 for everything you need to know to stay safe during severe weather. Chief Meteorologist Jeff Castle, Meteorologist Amber... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
